1
00:00:00,672 --> 00:00:04,342
(Raj:)No, it's time to put on some R. Kelly
and suck face.

2
00:00:05,511 --> 00:00:07,181
(Penny:)Oh, wow, is the evening over.

3
00:00:07,346 --> 00:00:08,476
[COMPUTER BEEPS]

4
00:00:08,639 --> 00:00:11,179
Wait, wait, wait. That's my mommy
and daddy calling from India.

5
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:12,850
(Raj(as a ringing noise is heard):)I want you to meet my parents.

6
00:00:13,018 --> 00:00:14,478
Wait, meet them?

7
00:00:17,481 --> 00:00:21,981
Hello, Mommy, Daddy. Good to see you.
How are you? I'm not drunk.

8
00:00:22,528 --> 00:00:25,488
- Why would you say that?
- Just making conversation.

9
00:00:25,656 --> 00:00:28,786
Mommy, Daddy, I want you to meet
my new squeeze, Penny.

10
00:00:28,951 --> 00:00:31,871
(Penny:)I am not your squeeze.
There is no squeezing.

11
00:00:32,037 --> 00:00:34,537
I can't see her. Center her in the frame.

12
00:00:34,706 --> 00:00:36,956
(Raj:)Here you go. Cute, huh?

13
00:00:37,709 --> 00:00:39,629
(Mrs Koothrappali:)She's not Indian.

14
00:00:39,795 --> 00:00:42,255
(Dr Koothrappali:)So she's not Indian.
The boy's sowing some wild oats.

15
00:00:42,422 --> 00:00:45,842
No, no, no, there's no sowing,
no squeezing and no sucking face.

16
00:00:47,052 --> 00:00:48,472
What if he gets her pregnant?

17
00:00:48,637 --> 00:00:52,177
Is this hotsy-totsy who you want
as the mother of your grandchildren?

18
00:00:52,724 --> 00:00:55,394
(Raj:)What right do you have
to pick whom I can have children with?

19
00:00:55,561 --> 00:00:57,811
(Dr Koothrappali:)Look, Rajesh, I understand,
you're in America...

20
00:00:57,980 --> 00:01:00,360
...you want to try the "local cuisine."

